153
00:09:53.792 --> 00:09:59.001
<i>When I'm better, I'd like to go.</i>

154
00:10:00.751 --> 00:10:05.792
"80-YEAR OLD BOY, AH-REUM"

155
00:10:08.001 --> 00:10:12.041
<i>When the illness became apparent,
Ah-reum moved to Bucheon,</i>

156
00:10:12.042 --> 00:10:14.251
<i>and receives weekly outpatient treatment.</i>

157
00:10:15.626 --> 00:10:17.376
<i>A day feels like a year to Ah-reum.</i>

158
00:10:17.917 --> 00:10:22.501
<i>He suffers from geriatric illnesses,
including heart disease.</i>

159
00:10:22.792 --> 00:10:26.500
