164
00:10:38.876 --> 00:10:41.791
<i>than normal people.</i>

165
00:10:41.792 --> 00:10:43.041
DR. LEE SEUNG-TAE (47)

166
00:10:43.042 --> 00:10:46.958
<i>Not only their skin, but
bones and organs too.</i>

167
00:10:46.959 --> 00:10:48.583
